  "description": "Our City 2 WSD Bike is the Swiss army knife of commuters. Combining design from road and mountain bike disciplines to get the best of both worlds. The City 2 WSD provides a unique, exciting commuter ride that is equally suited to the trails on the weekend.\nThe City 2 WSD commuter bike has the best of both road and mountain bikes, perfect for commuting, cruising and all-road adventures. The suspension fork and rugged frame mean that tracks and trails are accessible, without losing too much speed when back on the tarmac.\nWith powerful brakes, a huge range of gears, wide riser handlebars and mounts for both mudguards and a pannier rack, this city commuter bike is ready for commuting, touring and all-day adventures on roads, bike paths and sealed trails.",
